{"id":"lichno","lemma":"лично","pos":"adv","rank":570,"glosses":["personally, in person"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5e/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он пришел лично.","en":"He came in person.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null]},{"text":"Я знаю их лично.","en":"I know them personally.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"them / their"},null]},{"text":"Том хотел поблагодарить тебя лично.","en":"Tom wanted to thank you personally.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/656011","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to thank"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},null]},{"text":"Боюсь, тебе придется пойти лично.","en":"I'm afraid you'll have to go in person.","words":[{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},null,{"g":"to go"},null]},{"text":"Лично я так не думаю.","en":"I personally don't think so.","words":[null,null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[1,5,"I don't think so"]]}]}